# Files scripts/check-no-binaries.sh lets a change add even though git cannot
# diff them as text. One path or glob per line; * also crosses /.

# README screenshots (docs/images/README.md says how they are captured).
docs/images/*.png

# Go coverage data (GOCOVERDIR output of a -cover binary: covmeta.<hash> and
# covcounters.<hash>.<pid>.<nanotime>), the input pkg/testreport's
# ConvertCovdata reads. Real `go build -cover` output is the point of the
# fixture; pkg/testreport/coverage_test.go says how each one was made.
pkg/testreport/testdata/cover/cov*/covmeta.*
pkg/testreport/testdata/cover/cov*/covcounters.*
